  "published": "2026-09-13T10:38:31.73Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 Initial Stable Release:\n\t\t\t- Hardware-accelerated ModernMessageBox with modal execution and draggable header.\n\t\t\t- Non-blocking ModernToast notifications with auto-stacking queue management.\n\t\t\t- Native premultiplied alpha LayeredForm rendering with zero white corner artifacts.\n\t\t\t- 5 built-in design styles with dynamic Dark and Light theme switching.\n\t\t\t- Multi-targeting for .NET Framework 4.7.2/4.8 and .NET 6.0/8.0 Windows.",
